# 045 fix: exclude Windows build outputs from Linux image contexts.
# Without this, COPY . . overwrites the container's clean restore with host
# obj/project.assets.json containing
# 'C:\Program Files (x86)\Microsoft Visual Studio\Shared\NuGetPackages'
# fallback folders, failing Linux builds with MSB4018 (maintenance efbundle).
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/node_modules/
**/out/
**/TestResults/
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/Dockerfile*
**/.git/
.vs/
.git/
.github/
docs/
fixtures/
tests/
*.md
!global.json
!Directory.Build.props
!.config/dotnet-tools.json
